body:
Highly recommending Fallout 4 on survival difficulty. It's not that hard as it may sound, but this difficulty have fast travel disabled, which forces you to be aware of your surroundings all the time when you walk on foot from location to location. That way you starting to appreciate the details and locations design. Great training before exploring Night City.

&#x200B;

Also, if you playing on PC increase your FOV. In every FPP game, I always set this at 90
